      "comment": "DR. ZAIDEN (2) produced an impressive win last time in quickest of the meeting when scoring by half a length (24.35) at this track. Expected to go close again. PAW ESTRELLA (5) goes very well this trip starting 80 times for 29 wins and 27 minors. Below best last time at Warragul (22.92) in a Free For All, finishing a 3 length fourth. Can hit the frame with the right run. HE'S A COLLINDA (1) has a strong record here with three wins and three placings from nine starts. Below best last time at Warragul (22.99) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2.75 lengths fourth. Makes strong appeal on best. DR. CALISTA (3) is a last-start placegetter worth considering.",
